title: "GazeGrounded UX: task-aware multimodal detection of UX friction"
abstract: >-
  Research software that compares human gaze with task-conditioned vision-language model
  relevance on user interfaces, and combines gaze, interaction, visual and textual signals
  to study and predict UX friction.
